WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.400
A dim room, lit only by candles.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.260
No daylight gets in.

3
00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.830
A clock with its hands frozen.

4
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:11.380
And a watch that "had stopped
at twenty minutes to nine".

5
00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:13.350
A yellowed wedding dress.

6
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.030
One white shoe.

7
00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.530
A long table under cobwebs.

8
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.260
In the gloom, a boy and a girl play cards.

9
00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:24.690
So who is this frozen
room really punishing?

10
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.670
In this mission, you'll
hear Miss Havisham's story:

11
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.380
a letter breaks off her
marriage on her wedding day,

12
00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.570
and she stops every clock.

13
00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:35.530
You'll explore Satis
House as a Gothic setting:

14
00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:39.120
dark, decaying, a place of living death.

15
00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.800
And you'll meet the girl
she adopts, Estella,

16
00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.360
and ask what she is raising her for.

17
00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:48.530
Your mission: work out who Miss
Havisham is really punishing.
